hadiths[39]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1238","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni biwi ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein haiz ki haalat mein talaq di. Umar ne kaha: Phir main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Ibn Umar ko hukm do ke woh apni biwi se ruju' kare, phir use apne paas rakhe yahan tak ke woh haiz se paak ho jae. Phir use haiz aae phir woh paak ho. Phir agar chahe to use apne paas rakhe, aur agar chahe to use chhoone se pahle talaq de de. Yahi woh iddat hai jis mein Allah ne aurton ko talaq dene ka hukm diya hai.'"
"1239","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Aiman Maula Azzah ko Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se poochte suna jabke Abu Zubair sun rahe the. To us ne kaha: Us aadmi ke bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai jo apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq de? To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ne apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq di. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ibn Umar ko hukm do ke woh apni biwi se ruju' kare, aur jab woh paak ho jae to phir chahe to use talaq de ya use apne paas rakhe.' Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha, Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: 'Aey Nabi! Jab tum aurton ko talaq do to unhen in ki iddat ke aaghaz mein talaq do.' Shafi'i ko shak hua."
"1240","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai ke woh ise isi tarah padhte the."
"1241","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Dinar se, Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke woh isi tarah padhte the: Jab tum aurton ko talaq do to unhen in ki iddat ke aaghaz mein talaq do."
"1242","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Aiman ko Ibn Umar se poochte suna jabke Abu Zubair sun rahe the: Us aadmi ke bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai jo apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq de? To unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq di. Phir Umar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ibn Umar ko hukm do ke woh apni biwi se ruju' kare.' To us ne use mujhe wapas kar diya aur use kuch na samjha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab woh paak ho jae to phir chahe to use talaq de ya use apne paas rakhe.'"
"1243","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq di. Phir Umar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ibn Umar ko hukm do ke woh apni biwi se ruju' kare.' To us ne use mujhe wapas kar diya aur use kuch na samjha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab woh paak ho jae to phir chahe to use talaq de ya use apne paas rakhe.'"
"1244","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi ko haiz ki haalat mein talaq di. Phir Umar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ibn Umar ko hukm do ke woh apni biwi se ruju' kare, phir use apne paas rakhe yahan tak ke woh paak ho jae phir use haiz aae phir woh paak ho. Phir agar chahe to use apne paas rakhe, aur agar chahe to use chhoone se pahle talaq de de. Yahi woh iddat hai jis mein Allah Azza wa Jalla ne aurton ko talaq dene ka hukm diya hai.'"
"1245","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nafi' ke paas aadmi bhej kar poocha ke kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki di hui talaq shumar ki gai thi? Unhon ne kaha: 'Han.'"
"1246","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Abus Sahba ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane, Abu Bakr ki khilafat aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hukumat ke teen saal mein teen talaqon ko ek shumar kiya jata tha?' To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"1247","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Ibn Abbas se kaha: 'Main ne apni biwi ko sau martaba talaq di.' To unhon ne kaha: 'Teen le lo aur satanwe chhod do.'"
"1248","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Iyas bin Bukair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne apni biwi ko hambistari se pahle teen talaqen din, phir us ne us se nikah karne ka irada kiya. Phir woh fatwa lene aaya aur Abu Hurairah aur Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha. To un donon ne kaha: Hamari rae mein woh is se nikah nahin kar sakta yahan tak ke woh tumhare siwa doosre shauhar se nikah kare. To us ne kaha: Meri is ko talaq to ek thi. To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Tum ne apne hath se woh fazeelat nikal di jo tumhen hasil thi."
"1249","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi aaya aur Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha jis ne apni biwi ko chhoone se pahle teen talaqen din. Ata bin Yasar ne kaha: To main ne kaha: 'Kunwari ki talaq to ek hai.' To Abdullah bin Amr ne farmaya: 'Tum to qissa go ho. Ek use qat'i juda kar deti hai aur teen use haram kar deti hain yahan tak ke woh tumhare siwa doosre shauhar se nikah kare.'"
"1250","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Iyas bin Bukair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne apni biwi ko hambistari se pahle teen talaqen din. Phir jab us ne us aurat se dobara nikah ka irada kiya to woh hukm poochne aaya. To main is ke liye poochne is ke sath gaya. Phir us ne Abu Hurairah aur Abdullah bin Abbas se is ke bare mein poocha. To un donon ne kaha: Hamari rae mein tum is se nikah nahin kar sakte yahan tak ke woh tumhare siwa doosre shauhar se nikah kare. Us ne kaha: Meri is ko talaq to ek thi. To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Tum ne apne hath se woh fazeelat nikal di jo tumhen hasil thi. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurairah ne use teen par malamat nahin ki."
"1251","[AI-translation] Ata bin Yasar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi aaya aur Abdullah bin Amr se us aadmi ke bare mein fatwa poocha jis ne apni biwi ko chhoone se pahle teen talaqen din. Ata ne kaha: To main ne kaha: 'Kunwari ki talaq to ek hai.' To Abdullah bin Amr ne farmaya: 'Tum to qissa go ho. Ek use qat'i juda kar deti hai aur teen use haram kar deti hain yahan tak ke woh doosre shauhar se nikah kare.' Shafi'i ne farmaya: Abdullah ne use nahin kaha: Jab tum ne use teen talaqen din to tum ne bahut bura kiya."
"1252","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Ayyash se riwayat hai ke woh Abdullah bin Zubair aur Aasim bin Umar ke sath baithe the. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Muhammad bin Iyas bin Bukair in donon ke paas aae aur kaha: Dehat ka ek aadmi ne apni biwi ko hambistari se pahle teen talaqen din, to tum donon ki kya rae hai? To Ibn Zubair ne kaha: Is muamle mein hamari koi rae nahin hai. Ibn Abbas aur Abu Hurairah ke paas jao, kyunke main ne in donon ko Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas chhoda hai. Un se poocho phir hamare paas aao aur hamen khabar do. To woh gaya aur un se poocha. To Ibn Abbas ne Abu Hurairah se kaha: Fatwa den Aey Abu Hurairah! Tumhare paas mushkil muamla aaya hai. To Abu Hurairah ne farmaya: Ek use qat'i juda kar deti hai aur teen use haram kar deti hain yahan tak ke woh doosre shauhar se nikah kare. Aur Ibn Abbas ne isi ki misl kaha. Shafi'i ne farmaya: In donon aur Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne use teen par malamat nahin ki."
"1253","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja mutahhara Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rifa'ah ki biwi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Rifa'ah ne mujhe talaq di aur meri talaq ko qat'i kar diya. Abdur Rahman bin Zubair ne mujh se nikah kiya jabke is ke paas kapde ke kinare jaisa hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum Rifa'ah ki taraf wapas jana chahti ho? Nahin, yahan tak ke tum is ki mithas chakho aur woh tumhari mithas chakhe.'"
"1254","[AI-translation] Zubair bin Abdur Rahman bin Zubair se riwayat hai ke Rifa'ah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi Tamimah bint Wahb ko teen talaqen din. Phir Abdur Rahman bin Zubair ne us se nikah kiya magar is se alag raha aur use chhu na saka, aur use talaq de di. To Rifa'ah ne us se nikah ka irada kiya jabke woh is ka pahla shauhar tha jis ne use talaq di thi. To yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr kiya gaya. To Aap ne use is se nikah karne se mana farmaya aur farmaya: 'Woh tumhare liye halal nahin yahan tak ke woh mithas chakhe.'"
"1255","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja mutahhara Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne unhen kahte suna: Rifa'ah Qurazi ki biwi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: 'Main Rifa'ah ke paas thi aur us ne mujhe talaq di aur meri talaq ko qat'i kar diya. Phir main ne Abdur Rahman bin Zubair se nikah kiya, jabke is ke paas kapde ke kinare jaisa hai.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muskuraye aur farmaya: 'Kya tum Rifa'ah ki taraf wapas jana chahti ho? Nahin, yahan tak ke tum is ki mithas chakho aur woh tumhari mithas chakhe.' Unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas the aur Khalid bin Sa'id bin Aas darwaze par ijazat ke intezar mein the. To unhon ne pukara: Aey Abu Bakr! Kya tum nahin sunte jo yeh aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas buland awaz se kah rahi hai?!"
"1256","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne unhen kahte suna: Rifa'ah Qurazi ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: 'Main Rifa'ah ke paas thi aur us ne mujhe talaq di aur meri talaq ko qat'i kar diya. Phir us ke baad main ne Abdur Rahman bin Zubair se nikah kiya, jabke is ke paas kapde ke kinare jaisa hai.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muskuraye aur farmaya: 'Kya tum Rifa'ah ki taraf wapas jana chahti ho? Yeh nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke woh tumhari mithas chakhe aur tum is ki mithas chakho.' Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas the jabke Khalid bin Sa'id bin Aas darwaze par ijazat ke intezar mein the. Unhon ne pukara: Aey Abu Bakr! Kya tum nahin sunte jo yeh aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas buland awaz se kah rahi hai?"
"1257","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) farmate the ke jo apne ghulam ko nikah ki ijazat de to talaq ghulam ke hath mein hai, is ke siwa kisi ke hath mein is ki talaq mein se kuch nahin."
"1258","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi se riwayat hai ke Nufai' jo Ummul Momineen Sayyidah Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se kitabat kar chuke the, unhon ne Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se ek masle ke bare mein poocha: 'Main ne apni aazad biwi ko do talaqen din.' To Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Woh tum par haram ho gai hai.'"
"1259","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke Nufai' jo Ummul Momineen Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se kitabat kar chuke the, woh ghulam the jin ke nikah mein ek aazad aurat thi. Us ne use do talaqen din, phir woh us se ruju' karna chahta tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki pakeeza biwiyon ne use hukm diya ke woh Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ja kar is ke bare mein pooche. Woh in ke paas gaya aur unhen Darj ke maqam par paya, aur woh Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) ka hath pakde hue the. Us ne in donon se poocha, aur unhon ne fauran jawab diya: 'Woh tum par haram ho gai hai, woh tum par haram ho gai hai.'"
"1260","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Nufai' jo Ummul Momineen Sayyidah Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se kitabat kar chuke the, unhon ne apni aazad biwi ko do talaqen din. Phir unhon ne Usman ibn Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se is muamle ke bare mein poocha. To Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha ke woh tum par haram ho gai hai."
"1261","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Khul aur Bariyah mein bhi talaq teen martaba waqe hoti hai.'"
"1262","[AI-translation] Ummul Momineen Sayyidah Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) ke sath teen Sunnaten qaim huin. Un mein se ek yeh hai ke jab unhen aazad kiya gaya to unhen apne shauhar ke bare mein ikhtiyar diya gaya."
"1263","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne us laundi ke bare mein farmaya jo ghulam ke nikah mein ho aur us ka aaqa use aazad kar de: Agar is ke shauhar ne is se sohbat na ki ho to use ikhtiyar hai, lekin agar us ne is se sohbat kar li ho to use ikhtiyar nahin."
"1264","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair se riwayat hai ke Banu Adi bin Ka'b ki aazad karda laundi, jis ka naam Zabra tha, ne unhen khabar di ke woh ek ghulam ke nikah mein thi, aur us waqt woh laundi thi jab is ke aaqa ne use aazad kiya. Woh kahti hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi Hafsa (Raziyallahu anha) ne mujhe paigham bhej kar bulaya, aur kaha: 'Main tumhen ek baat batane wali hun, aur main pasand nahin karti ke tum jaldi mein kuch karo. Woh yeh hai ke tumhara muamla ab tumhare apne hath mein hai jab tak tumhara shauhar tum se sohbat na kare.' To us ne apne shauhar se teen martaba alahdagi ikhtiyar ki."
"1265","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai ke Bani Adi ki aazad karda laundi, jis ka naam Zabra tha, ne unhen khabar di ke jab woh laundi thi to woh ek ghulam mard se nikah shuda thi. Is ke aaqa ne use aazad kar diya. Woh kahti hain ke Hafsa (Raziyallahu anha) ne mujhe paigham ke sath bulaya aur kaha: 'Main tumhen ek baat batane wali hun, aur main nahin chahti ke tum jaldi mein kuch karo, aur woh yeh hai: Ab tumhara muamla tumhare apne hath mein hai jab tak tumhara shauhar tum se sohbat na kare.' Woh kahti hain ke us ne us se teen martaba alahdagi ikhtiyar ki. Imam Shafi'i ne farmaya ke Hafsa (Raziyallahu anha) ne un se nahin kaha ke tumhare liye use teen talaqen dena jaiz nahin hai."
"1266","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab un ke samne Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) ke shauhar ka zikr hua to unhon ne kaha: 'Woh Mughis tha, falan qabeela ka ghulam. Goya main use ab bhi dekh raha hun, rote hue raste mein is ke peeche chalta tha.'"
"1267","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) ka shauhar ghulam tha."
"1268","[AI-translation] Ibn Sirin se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jis ke hath mein nikah ki girah hai woh shauhar hai.'"
"1269","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha ke jis ke hath mein nikah ki girah hai woh shauhar hai."
"1270","[AI-translation] Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai ke unhen yeh khabar Sa'id bin Musayyab se pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha: 'Woh shauhar hai.'"
"1271","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Us ke liye mahar aadha hai, aur is par bilkul iddat nahin hai, yani us aurat ke bare mein jis ke liye Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Aur agar tum unhen chhoone se pahle talaq do jabke tum in ke liye mahar muqarrar kar chuke ho, to jo tum ne muqarrar kiya hai is ka aadha do [Baqarah: 237], aur Allah Ta'ala ka farman: Phir agar tum unhen chhoone se pahle talaq do to tumhare liye in par koi iddat nahin hai jise tum gino [Ahzab: 49].'"
"1272","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh farmate the: 'Har talaq yafta aurat ke liye mut'ah hai siwae us aurat ke jis ka mahar muqarrar ho chuka ho aur phir use hambistari se pahle talaq di gai ho, is ke liye is ka aadha mahar kafi hoga.'"
"1273","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke woh farmate the: Har talaq yafta aurat ke liye talaq par kharcha hai, siwae us ke jis ka mahar muqarrar ho chuka ho aur phir use chhooe baghair talaq di gai ho, is ke liye sirf muqarrar karda mahar gina jaega."
"1274","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne us aadmi ke bare mein kaha jis ne ek aurat se nikah kiya aur is se tanhai ikhtiyar ki magar is se sohbat na ki, phir use talaq de di, ke is ke liye aadhe mahar ke siwa kuch nahin, kyunke Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: 'Aur agar tum unhen chhoone se pahle talaq do jabke tum in ke liye mahar muqarrar kar chuke ho, to jo tum ne muqarrar kiya hai is ka aadha do [Baqarah: 237].'"
"1275","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mut'im ne apne walid se bayan kiya ke unhon ne ek aurat se nikah kiya aur is se hambistari se pahle use talaq de di, phir unhon ne use poora mahar bhej diya. Jab is muamle ke bare mein un se poocha gaya to unhon ne kaha: 'Baqi maal ko kharch karne ka mujhe zyada haq hai.'"
"1276","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah, aur Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kahte suna: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se Bahrain ke us aadmi ke bare mein poocha jis ne apni biwi ko ek ya do talaqen din, phir is ki iddat khatm ho gai. Phir is se doosre aadmi ne nikah kiya, phir us ne use talaq de di ya woh faut ho gaya, phir is se is ke pahle shauhar ne nikah kiya. Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Ab yeh shauhar is ke paas baqi talaqon ka haqdar hoga.'"
